nswer is\\n    then \\\"at this model, scaffold and difficulty mix, CoT does not measurably improve\\n    WorkArena++ task solving, and effects larger than RHO are excluded\\\" \\u2014 **not** \\\"CoT cannot\\n    help\\\". The report must state the smallest excludable effect the run actually achieved.\\n  \\u2013 Otherwise *\\\"inconclusive\\\"*, with the achieved excludable effect size stated.\\n  \\u2013 A raw win that reverses in the CoT \\u00d7 k 2\\u00d72 (CoT@1 \\u2248 no-CoT@5) is reported as\\n    *\\\"aggregation, not reasoning\\\"*.\\n\\n## 8. Feasibility and honest fallbacks\\n\\nA real run needs (i) a provisioned ServiceNow instance with the Agent Development Kit plus\\nthe WorkArena++ suite, and (ii) model access. **Neither exists in this sandbox**: no network\\n(DNS resolution fails), no GPU (no `/dev/nvidia*`; `nvidia-smi` cannot reach a driver), and\\nno scientific/agent stack (no numpy/pandas/scipy/playwright/openai; stdlib + `requests`\\nonly). Hence this deliverable is a specification plus stdlib-only artifacts.\\n* No resets/repetitions possible \\u2192 fall back to a **single-run matched-pair** analysis:\\n  McNemar still applies to one paired run per task; precision drops to R=1, the pilot's `pd`\\n  must be treated as optimistic, and any equivalence claim must be dropped.\\n* No per-step token/latency logging \\u2192 **drop the co-primary and every efficiency claim**,\\n  downgrading the question to outcome-only, stated as a limitation.\\n* Oracle exposes one bit per task \\u2192 drop checklist-coverage.\\n* Harness forbids system-prompt edits \\u2192 move the manipulation to a wrapper harness and\\n  disclose the weakened matched-conditions guarantee.\\n\\n## 9. If an ablation already exists in the source\\n\\nContribution becomes: (a) a *structurally* matched non-CoT control (same turn structure,\\ntoken-balanced prompt, shared parser) instead of a bare baseline; (b) explicit separation of\\nCoT from self-consistency via the 2\\u00d72; (c) 